[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8161.189, "timestamp": "02:16:01", "text": "だから私も彼と一緒にそこに行きます。   他に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8164.47, "timestamp": "02:16:04", "text": "何か？  [鼻を鳴らす]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8167.35, "timestamp": "02:16:07", "text": "ああ、夜にはそうなるだろう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8169.189, "timestamp": "02:16:09", "text": "夜、明るいうちにやろう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8173.43, "timestamp": "02:16:13", "text": "夜に配信するように努力してみます。 正直、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8177.83, "timestamp": "02:16:17", "text": "夜はのんびりして寝たいんだけど、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8180.379, "timestamp": "02:16:20", "text": "「わかった、わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8192.469, "timestamp": "02:16:32", "text": "登録してね。え、今"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8194.898, "timestamp": "02:16:34", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "flexing"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8199.669, "timestamp": "02:16:39", "text": "待って、待って、待って、待って、待って。登録したの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8202.549, "timestamp": "02:16:42", "text": "メンバーシップベーカーに参加してくれてありがとう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8209.03, "timestamp": "02:16:49", "text": "こんにちは。"}]